1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:01,500
Little Moments.

2
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:03,146
The Last Slice.

3
00:00:03,146 --> 00:00:05,187
Movie night is about to start.

4
00:00:05,187 --> 00:00:10,573
There are blankets on the couch, drinks on the table, and exactly one slice of pizza left in the box.

5
00:00:10,573 --> 00:00:12,927
Ben and I notice it at the same time.

6
00:00:13,204 --> 00:00:14,862
Are you going to eat that?

7
00:00:15,100 --> 00:00:16,687
I was thinking about it.

8
00:00:16,687 --> 00:00:17,802
Were you?

9
00:00:18,076 --> 00:00:20,736
I've been thinking about it for a very long time.

10
00:00:20,736 --> 00:00:22,861
Since the last slice I ate.

11
00:00:23,140 --> 00:00:24,769
Sounds serious.

12
00:00:24,769 --> 00:00:26,925
How are you two going to solve this?

13
00:00:27,196 --> 00:00:28,711
We could race for it.

14
00:00:28,711 --> 00:00:30,773
Dad raises one eyebrow.

15
00:00:30,773 --> 00:00:32,638
Okay, maybe not.

16
00:00:32,638 --> 00:00:33,992
Let's split it.

17
00:00:34,276 --> 00:00:36,572
But one side has more cheese.

18
00:00:36,572 --> 00:00:38,947
And one side has the big mushroom.

19
00:00:39,220 --> 00:00:41,170
You don't even like mushrooms.

20
00:00:41,404 --> 00:00:43,176
I might start tonight.

21
00:00:43,396 --> 00:00:44,911
Here's an idea.

22
00:00:44,911 --> 00:00:48,192
One person cuts, and the other person chooses a piece.

23
00:00:48,460 --> 00:00:50,558
You cut, and I'll choose.

24
00:00:50,558 --> 00:00:53,589
Ben studies the pizza like it's a very important map.

25
00:00:53,589 --> 00:00:57,172
Dad helps him use the pizza cutter, and we look at the two pieces.

26
00:00:57,460 --> 00:00:59,204
They're almost the same.

27
00:00:59,204 --> 00:01:01,829
Except this one has a tiny extra corner.

28
00:01:02,116 --> 00:01:03,985
I choose the other piece.

29
00:01:03,985 --> 00:01:07,266
Ben looks surprised, then takes the corner with a smile.

30
00:01:07,266 --> 00:01:09,745
We sit down just as the movie starts.

31
00:01:10,012 --> 00:01:11,597
Everybody happy?

32
00:01:11,836 --> 00:01:13,278
Very happy.

33
00:01:13,278 --> 00:01:16,548
Next time, though, could we order one more pizza?

34
00:01:16,828 --> 00:01:18,301
Dad laughs.

35
00:01:18,301 --> 00:01:21,468
I take a bite and discover the big mushroom on my piece.

36
00:01:21,468 --> 00:01:25,645
Apparently, Ben has decided not to start liking mushrooms tonight after all.
